SQL knowledge required; ability to write, optimize, and troubleshoot queries;
Scripting experience for automation and tooling purposes;
Ability to take ownership of projects and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders;
Familiarity with Agile development methodologies and test-driven development practices;
